  "name": "Ale of the God-King follows the naturally filled Tankard (#5804)",
  "contract": [
    "At level 43, Ancestry uses Ale rank 573224. Its Spell.dbc CasterAuraSpell is Full Tankard 805814;",
    "the spell is an active pet-targeted aura, not a passive. Fill Level 92083 grants periodic helper 500061,",
    "which adds one stack of 805813 every 2000 ms. Fill Level has a ten-stack limit and Full Tankard has",
    "an authored amount of ten. Ale must be refused before the Tankard fills, then empower the Honored",
    "Ancestor and consume Fill Level. Breath's five-second Empty Tankard 806055 window follows spending",
    "the resource. The Finest Ale 705218 explicitly prevents Ale from emptying the Tankard, so it must",
    "preserve both the stacks and Full Tankard without granting a new Empty Tankard window. Stack reduction",
    "must withdraw Full Tankard, and removing the level passive must stop filling and remove resource state."
  ],
